# SVN revision diff
# Source: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/civ4betterai/code/
# Revision: 202
# Author: iustus
# Date: 2006-12-18T21:02:41.973636Z
# Coverage: full
# Message:
#   city builds:
#   - will build sea attack units in addition to escort and assault (should be about 1/4 as many attack as assault)
#   - dagger builds will build barracks first, not 2nd
#   - wonder builds slightly increased, particularly in the first 100 turns, or when there are more than 3 cities
#   - cheap building is built after the wonder random check
#   rangeIndexToXY improved, now you do not have to keep track of an iterator, it returns false when there are no more plots at that range
#   using isLimitedWonderClass to catch team wonders (for mods) in AI_bestTech
#   missionaries valued more as a build if the owner owns the holy city (now a missionary counts slightly more for a holy city over a non-holy city state religion)
#   added some zero population checks in AI_calculateAverages
#   added a group version of canBombard
#   canMoveInto now returns true when bAttack is true and there is an empty city with no units
#   sea assault stacks which have units that can bombard will stop to bombard the city before returning to pick up more units
#   missionaries will strongly dislike spreading religion to other team's cities if they own at least one holy cities but not the holy city for that missionary's religion
#   land units will not bombard cities with zero enemies or when they have attack odds over 95%
#   
# Changed paths (8):
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvCityAI.cpp
